Agreements that allows for public use for climate and health applications.", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/2a56f8ad-463b-4b0e-ad76-a7df610313d7/download/disease_psa_totals.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-17T16:37:37.964796\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-17T16:37:41.001416\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/2a56f8ad-463b-4b0e-ad76-a7df610313d7/download/disease_psa_totals.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 41578, \"ncols\": 9, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"ada8d01be861b576332fb1c83099df8a\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"freq\", \"date\", \"source_name\", \"source_filename\", \"adm3_pcode\", \"disease_icd10_code\", \"disease_common_name\", \"death_total\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/2a56f8ad-463b-4b0e-ad76-a7df610313d7/download/disease_psa_totals.csv", "id": "2a56f8ad-463b-4b0e-ad76-a7df610313d7", "last_modified": "2024-06-17T16:37:38.158452", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:09.311488", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "disease_psa_totals.csv", "originalHash": "-988266717", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 2, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 3708547, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/2a56f8ad-463b-4b0e-ad76-a7df610313d7/download/disease_psa_totals.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-06-17T16:40:41.203384", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Baranggay-level age and sex-disaggregated disease deaths (mortality) and cases (morbidity) from reports submitted by the LGU to DOH-Field Health Services Information System (DOH-FHSIS) or Department of Health- Philippine Integrated Disease Surveillance and Response (DOH-PISDR). When adm4_pcode is not available, data is in a city level resolution. This data, requested by Epimetrics from their respective data owners, is governed by Data Use Agreements that allows for public use for climate and health applications.", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-17T16:40:40.728074\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-17T16:40:43.856156\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 48736, \"ncols\": 13, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"181fad23c2dc9d33ab4584062f790ee0\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"freq\", \"date\", \"source_name\", \"source_filename\", \"adm3_pcode\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"disease_icd10_code\", \"disease_common_name\", \"sex\", \"age_group\", \"case_total\", \"death_total\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}, {\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-25T17:01:41.724018\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-06-25T17:01:45.034456\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 48736, \"ncols\": 13, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"181fad23c2dc9d33ab4584062f790ee0\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"freq\", \"date\", \"source_name\", \"source_filename\", \"adm3_pcode\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"disease_icd10_code\", \"disease_common_name\", \"sex\", \"age_group\", \"case_total\", \"death_total\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv", "id": "1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173", "last_modified": "2024-06-25T17:01:41.928818", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:12.209345", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv", "originalHash": "-111502455", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 3, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 5837932, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/1f10c8ee-37a9-40b6-a18a-e8fbe4bb7173/download/disease_lgu_disaggregated_totals.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:09:21.505295", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Long term basic weather parameters related to the atmosphere. \r\n\r\nFor parameters extracted from **ERA5**, Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) was converted to Philippine Time (PHT) by adding 8 hours. The daily values were determined by taking the average per day (00:00 PHT - 23:00 PHT). \r\n\r\nFor parameters extracted from **CHIRPS** (precipitation and precipitation-derived indices), it is worth noting that it is a land-only datasets and barangays with no available data may not have been represented as land in the dataset. Datasets for temperature and precipitation were chosen based on an evaluation comparing values with ground truth data from the Philippine Atmospheric, Geophysical, and Astronomical Services Administration (PAGASA).", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029/download/climate_atmosphere.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:09:20.637855\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:10:18.145733\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029/download/climate_atmosphere.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 6421096, \"ncols\": 13, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"830a246c3d231af9f859e1e7c1bec03d\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"tave\", \"tmin\", \"tmax\", \"heat_index\", \"pr\", \"wind_speed\", \"rh\", \"solar_rad\", \"uv_rad\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029/download/climate_atmosphere.csv", "id": "8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:09:20.970821", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:14.027114", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_atmosphere.csv", "originalHash": "-988266717", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 4, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 570037886, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8bf5b884-77af-4c38-aeee-3380a4d8e029/download/climate_atmosphere.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-09-30T17:15:36.419514", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Output from the [Project CCHAIN deep learning climate downscaling model](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain-climate-downscaling/). The model yielded improved minimum temperature, maximum temperature and rainfall by enhancing its resolution from the reanalysis scale (0.25\u00b0) to local scale (0.02\u00b0). While we provide the full downscaled output as [gridded netcdf files here](https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1mXaFEhMYZnLzUCX3RciK5JEmguf_UHdd) for all the 12 cities, only those variables that passed our quality checks (QC) are included in this table.\r\n\r\nKindly read the [documentation](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain-climate-downscaling/) before deciding to use this data. If you are uncertain, consider using the climate_atmosphere table instead", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07/download/climate_atmosphere_downscaled.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-09-30T17:15:35.852516\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-09-30T17:16:01.537625\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07/download/climate_atmosphere_downscaled.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 5909746, \"ncols\": 6, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"15b8ba41e9d5646ac74d8c322b634b3e\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"date\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"tmin\", \"tmax\", \"tave\", \"pr\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07/download/climate_atmosphere_downscaled.csv", "id": "a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07", "last_modified": "2024-09-30T17:15:36.089790", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:16.055969", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_atmosphere_downscaled.csv", "originalHash": "8750915", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 5, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 243949312, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/a070a35e-5b75-44de-a1b2-08bc7aa2ff07/download/climate_atmosphere_downscaled.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:09:57.872799", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Long term estimates of air quality parameters. \r\n\r\nFor parameters extracted from **ERA5**, Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) was converted to Philippine Time (PHT) by adding 8 hours. The daily values were determined by taking the average per day (00:00 PHT - 23:00 PHT).\r\n\r\nFor parameters extracted from **CAMS**, 3-hourly UTC values were converted to PHT by adding 8 hours. As such, there is no value for 2003-01-01 and the value for 2003-01-02 is the mean of the available six timesteps. Complete data is available for 2003-01-03 onwards.\r\n\r\nFor parameters extracted from **MERRA-2**, 3-hourly UTC values were converted to PHT by adding 8 hours. ", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d/download/climate_air_quality.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:09:57.284079\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:10:30.535400\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d/download/climate_air_quality.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 6421096, \"ncols\": 10, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"fee26a61fba8b85e341b12f521961c91\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"no2\", \"co\", \"so2\", \"o3\", \"pm10\", \"pm25\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d/download/climate_air_quality.csv", "id": "762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:09:57.503763", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:19.012968", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_air_quality.csv", "originalHash": "-988266717", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 6, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 456724950, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/762426c4-b28a-43be-9fec-1ad564d3c38d/download/climate_air_quality.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:10:21.150316", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Long term estimates of rainfall-derived parameters.\r\n\r\nNote that these indices were all derived from precipitation values from **CHIRPS** which is a land-only dataset. Barangays with no available data may not have been represented as land. ", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768/download/climate_indices.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:10:19.794649\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:10:25.647217\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768/download/climate_indices.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 210721, \"ncols\": 8, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"50b1e3f2226e57ee8211a82eaed0f996\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"pr_norm\", \"spi3\", \"spi6\", \"pnp\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768/download/climate_indices.csv", "id": "b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:10:20.274669", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:20.379509", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_indices.csv", "originalHash": "-988266717", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 7, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 12794497, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/b1454765-704c-47ad-ae15-43a4d010f768/download/climate_indices.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:11:22.838735", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Long term estimates of land-related parameters.\r\n\r\nIn the selection of an NDVI dataset, MCD19A3CMG was preferred over MCD19A3D due to its provision in a geographic latitude and longitude coordinate system and the collection of data in one raw file per day.", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f/download/climate_land.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:11:21.835002\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:11:49.094051\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f/download/climate_land.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 6421096, \"ncols\": 5, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"b0d45514a3d85fab10356a0532f5b9d2\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"ndvi\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f/download/climate_land.csv", "id": "07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:11:22.072197", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:23.972196", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_land.csv", "originalHash": "-988266717", "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 8, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 268986130, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/07014e15-bdee-4a8e-a0ae-9e58d790432f/download/climate_land.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/80d541cb-73d5-4201-b7da-80b77f0c9bd8/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:12:13.988443", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "**DOES NOT CONTAIN CLIMATE VARIABLES**. Log of hourly timesteps used to check the aggregates generated by processing raw climate parameters to daily scale, extracted from MERRA-2 in `climate_air_quality`. Use this only as QC layer to `climate_air_quality`\n\nThis table is to be used in conjunction with `climate_air_quality` where carbon monoxide (CO) and sulfur dioxide (SO2) are extracted from MERRA-2. There is a possibility of missing timesteps after conversion to local time and so the number of timesteps available daily were extracted to quantify the reliability of data.", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/80d541cb-73d5-4201-b7da-80b77f0c9bd8/download/climate_timestep_check.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:12:13.287220\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:12:36.129217\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/80d541cb-73d5-4201-b7da-80b77f0c9bd8/download/climate_timestep_check.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 6421096, \"ncols\": 6, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"6650745da061fc55ad21a79551979f5c\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"co_n_timesteps_aggregated\", \"so2_n_timesteps_aggregated\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/80d541cb-73d5-4201-b7da-80b77f0c9bd8/download/climate_timestep_check.csv", "id": "80d541cb-73d5-4201-b7da-80b77f0c9bd8", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:12:13.492871", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:25.277027", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "climate_timestep_check.csv", "originalHash": -29509839, "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "