ocial_hygiene_clinic_nearest\", \"doh_medical_clinic_count\", \"doh_medical_clinic_nearest\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/3ca89d0e-3671-4f63-8dff-9af3e05b93cc/download/geoportal_doh_poi_health.csv", "id": "3ca89d0e-3671-4f63-8dff-9af3e05b93cc", "last_modified": "2024-06-25T17:01:36.069044", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:28.975275", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "geoportal_doh_poi_health.csv", "originalHash": 1368582783, "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 10, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 146011, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/3ca89d0e-3671-4f63-8dff-9af3e05b93cc/download/geoportal_doh_poi_health.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:26:29.269993", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Select OpenStreetMap (OSM) amenities that include basic public and private service facilities for communities. List of all available OSM amenity types can be found in their [wiki page](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Map_features#Amenity). Statistics for each POI type (sum and nearest distance) was done for every barangay through vector zonal statistics. \n\nTo note, during our investigation it was found that there are not a lot of POIs particularly for hospitals and clinics. Making sure that we captured as much data as possible we augmented this by also processing OSM buildings and filtering only those that related to health and added them to the dataset. Further details on the processing of POIs and OSM buildings can be found in the [github repository](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain/tree/main/notebooks/02_dataset_alignment/osm).", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530/download/osm_poi_amenity.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:26:28.434374\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:26:31.532028\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530/download/osm_poi_amenity.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 7912, \"ncols\": 38, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"5e7249fe60ada31fc46ae911844ae856\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"atm_count\", \"atm_nearest\", \"bank_count\", \"bank_nearest\", \"college_count\", \"college_nearest\", \"community_centre_count\", \"community_centre_nearest\", \"convenience_count\", \"convenience_nearest\", \"fire_station_count\", \"fire_station_nearest\", \"kindergarten_count\", \"kindergarten_nearest\", \"lighthouse_count\", \"lighthouse_nearest\", \"market_place_count\", \"market_place_nearest\", \"park_count\", \"park_nearest\", \"police_count\", \"police_nearest\", \"school_count\", \"school_nearest\", \"shelter_count\", \"shelter_nearest\", \"supermarket_count\", \"supermarket_nearest\", \"telephone_count\", \"telephone_nearest\", \"town_hall_count\", \"town_hall_nearest\", \"university_count\", \"university_nearest\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530/download/osm_poi_amenity.csv", "id": "fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:26:28.721793", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:30.197795", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "osm_poi_amenity.csv", "originalHash": -1078864599, "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 11, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 2661009, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/fb7040cf-4bbc-49ec-9721-7e13ba3c9530/download/osm_poi_amenity.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:27:56.091200", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "OpenStreetMap (OSM) health facilities available for each barangay. Listed in the [OSM wiki page](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Map_features#Healthcare) are the different POIs related to health are available. Statistics for each POI type (sum and nearest distance) was calculated for every barangay through vector zonal statistics. \n\nTo note, during our investigation it was found that there are not a lot of POIs particularly for hospitals and clinics. Making sure that we captured as much data as possible we augmented this by also processing OSM buildings and filtering using the building types only those that related to health and added them to this dataset. Further details on the processing of POIs and OSM buildings can be found in the [github repository](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain/tree/main/notebooks/02_dataset_alignment/osm).", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b/download/osm_poi_health.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:27:55.650250\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:28:00.685501\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b/download/osm_poi_health.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 7912, \"ncols\": 16, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"06009305378fca375f077ce5b2ab6e5a\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"clinic_count\", \"clinic_nearest\", \"dentist_count\", \"dentist_nearest\", \"doctors_count\", \"doctors_nearest\", \"hospital_count\", \"hospital_nearest\", \"optician_count\", \"optician_nearest\", \"pharmacy_count\", \"pharmacy_nearest\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b/download/osm_poi_health.csv", "id": "6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:27:55.853654", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:33.948993", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "osm_poi_health.csv", "originalHash": -1471835264, "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 12, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 1110609, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/6d3dab4b-69d6-49f0-8121-67277612041b/download/osm_poi_health.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:29:27.424543", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "OpenStreetMap (OSM) has a category of amenities for water and sanitation facilities. List of the available water and sanitation facilities can be found in their [wiki page](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Map_features#Waste_Management) along with the description of each POI. Statistics for each POI type (sum and nearest distance) was done for every barangay through vector zonal statistics. \n\nTo note, during our investigation it was found that there are not a lot of POIs particularly for hospitals and clinics. Making sure that we captured as much data as possible we augmented this by also processing OSM buildings and filtering only those that related to health and added them to the dataset. Further details on the processing of POIs and OSM buildings can be found in the [github repository](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain/tree/main/notebooks/02_dataset_alignment/osm).\n", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332/download/osm_poi_sanitation.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:29:26.452407\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:29:32.222324\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332/download/osm_poi_sanitation.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 7912, \"ncols\": 25, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"91c19a404328ea9d785cc409b86ae7fe\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"date\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"freq\", \"drinking_water_count\", \"drinking_water_nearest\", \"water_mill_count\", \"water_mill_nearest\", \"water_tower_count\", \"water_tower_nearest\", \"water_works_count\", \"water_works_nearest\", \"water_well_count\", \"water_well_nearest\", \"sanitary_dump_station_count\", \"sanitary_dump_station_nearest\", \"toilet_count\", \"toilet_nearest\", \"recycling_count\", \"waste_basket_count\", \"waste_basket_nearest\", \"wastewater_plant_count\", \"wastewater_plant_nearest\", \"waste_transfer_station_count\", \"waste_transfer_station_nearest\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332/download/osm_poi_sanitation.csv", "id": "eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:29:26.798835", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:36.131769", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "osm_poi_sanitation.csv", "originalHash": -1032109547, "p_coded": false, "package_id": "5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5", "pii": "false", "position": 13, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 1438233, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/eb1341ec-296f-442c-a741-6e78fca31332/download/osm_poi_sanitation.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8e4b51fc-3b92-4012-b69a-2d23ed454654/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2024-05-01T15:32:45.884233", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "Using the OpenStreetMap (OSM) water bodies and waterways their nearest distance of each barangay was calculated. See definitions in these links for [OSM water bodies](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:water) and [OSM waterways](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:waterway). Nearest distance for each water/waterway type was done for every barangay through vector zonal statistics. \n\nFurther details on the processing of POIs and OSM buildings can be found in the [github repository](https://github.com/thinkingmachines/project-cchain/tree/main/notebooks/02_dataset_alignment/osm).\n", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8e4b51fc-3b92-4012-b69a-2d23ed454654/download/osm_poi_water_body.csv", "format": "CSV", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\", \"message\": \"The processing of the file structure check has started\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:32:44.937152\"}, {\"state\": \"success\", \"message\": \"File structure check completed\", \"timestamp\": \"2024-05-01T15:32:49.073878\", \"sheet_changes\": [], \"hxl_proxy_response\": {\"url_or_filename\": \"https://data.humdata.org/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8e4b51fc-3b92-4012-b69a-2d23ed454654/download/osm_poi_water_body.csv\", \"format\": \"CSV\", \"sheets\": [{\"name\": \"__DEFAULT__\", \"nrows\": 7912, \"ncols\": 13, \"is_hidden\": false, \"has_merged_cells\": false, \"is_hxlated\": false, \"header_hash\": \"93eebbf584ca861e01f990f885d7c7db\", \"hxl_header_hash\": null, \"headers\": [\"uuid\", \"adm4_pcode\", \"date\", \"freq\", \"osm_wetland_nearest\", \"osm_reservoir_nearest\", \"osm_water_nearest\", \"osm_riverbank_nearest\", \"osm_dock_nearest\", \"osm_river_nearest\", \"osm_stream_nearest\", \"osm_canal_nearest\", \"osm_drain_nearest\"], \"hxl_headers\": null}]}}]", "hash": "", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/5b580664-365e-4d7e-b5e5-2990df8f12a5/resource/8e4b51fc-3b92-4012-b69a-2d23ed454654/download/osm_poi_water_body.csv", "id": "8e4b51fc-3b92-4012-b69a-2d23ed454654", "last_modified": "2024-05-01T15:32:45.465091", "metadata_modified": "2025-04-15T16:19:39.960913", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "osm_poi_water_body.csv", "originalH