for Humanitarian Data's website, https://centre.humdata.org. Please note that if you wish to access these files, we recommend you use the Resources section of the Centre's website rather than downloading from HDX.", "num_resources": 116, "num_tags": 0, "organization": {"id": "hdx", "name": "hdx", "title": "HDX", "type": "organization", "description": "The Humanitarian Data Exchange (HDX) is an open data sharing platform managed by the United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs. The HDX organization is managed by the HDX data team and is used to share data on behalf of a number of partners", "image_url": "http://labs.reliefweb.int/img/rw-thumbnail-hdx.png", "created": "2014-04-02T12:19:44.486326", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "hdx", "package_creator": "alexg", "pageviews_last_14_days": 43, "private": false, "qa_completed": false, "solr_additions": "{\"countries\": [\"World\"]}", "state": "active", "subnational": "0", "title": "Repository for PDF files", "total_res_downloads": 152381, "type": "dataset", "url": null, "version": null, "groups": [{"description": "", "display_name": "World", "id": "world", "image_display_url": "", "name": "world", "title": "World"}], "resources": [{"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/9f83159c-5cda-47ab-b5fe-597034c37bd8/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-03-11T08:21:39.228111", "dataset_preview_enabled": false, "datastore_active": false, "description": "The State of Open Humanitarian Data 2026 contains details on the data available for each location, category and sub-category covered in the HDX Data Grids. It includes sections exploring changes to data availability, an overview of the impact of AI bots on web traffic and open data platforms following the aggressive rollout of LLMs, and a closer look at the organizations that contribute climate hazards data.", "d