a (SDC, por sus siglas en ingl\u00e9s), un m\u00e9todo para evitar el riesgo de re-identificaci\u00f3n al gestionar encuestas con informaci\u00f3n confidencial  y datos de evaluaci\u00f3n de necesidades (microdatos).", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/fff9d4bc-eac1-4009-8455-81df40dbe1b3/download/guidance-note-1-spanish.pdf", "format": "PDF", "hash": "\"1685634259.406-413064-2761365294\"", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/fff9d4bc-eac1-4009-8455-81df40dbe1b3/download/guidance-note-1-spanish.pdf", "id": "fff9d4bc-eac1-4009-8455-81df40dbe1b3", "last_modified": "2023-06-01T15:44:19", "metadata_modified": "2025-03-10T23:35:44.934305", "microdata": false, "mimetype": "application/pdf", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Guidance Note 1 Spanish.pdf", "originalHash": "2142978380", "package_id": "2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8", "pii": "false", "position": 76, "resource_type": "file.upload", "size": 413064, "state": "active", "url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/fff9d4bc-eac1-4009-8455-81df40dbe1b3/download/guidance-note-1-spanish.pdf", "url_type": "upload"}, {"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/769c08ef-b269-4cfc-b976-8b7fb5a4719c/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2022-02-14T20:47:20.224467", "datastore_active": false, "description": "C\u00f3mo abordar incidentes relacionados con la gesti\u00f3n de datos que han causado da\u00f1o o tienen el potencial de causar da\u00f1o.", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/769c08ef-b269-4cfc-b976-8b7fb5a4719c/download/guidance-note-2-spanish.pdf", "format": "PDF", "hash": "\"1685634261.148-1231693-3444381782\"", "hdx_rel_url": "/dataset/2048a947-5714-4220-905b-e662cbcd14c8/resource/769c08ef-b269-4cfc-b976-8b7fb5a4719c/download/guidance